  "reviews": {
    "summary": "2 reviews\nFionn Celebrían  recommends Junk-B-gone.\n\nHighly recommend Junk-B-gone. They have done a fantastic job of collecting a large amount of old garden furniture, and some dismantled sheds and broken fence panels following a big shed and garden clear out. Reasonable price, prompt communication and very efficient service.\n1\n1\n1\nKerry-anne Chung\n\n49w\nThank you for your kind words\nReply",
    "items": [
      {
        "text": "Highly recommend Junk-B-gone. They have done a fantastic job of collecting a large amount of old garden furniture, and some dismantled sheds and broken fence panels following a big shed and garden clear out. Reasonable price, prompt communication and very efficient service.",
        "author": "Fionn Celebrían",
        "recommends": true,
        "headline": "Fionn Celebrían recommends Junk-B-gone."
      },
      {
        "text": "Cannot recommend these guys enough! We gave them a challenging job (large quantity of mixed rubbish and awkward access) and they have completed it without any problem and in a very timely fashion.  Definitely be using them again!",
