    {
      "text": "Ahoy, mateys!\nTo celebrate Rocquaine Regatta this Saturday, Fort Grey will be FREE to enter from 10:00-16:30.\nExplore our special pirate-themed trail, hunt for hidden treasure, and collect a prize if you find it all!\n#guernsey #guernseymuseums #regatta #pirates #maritimmuseum #localhistory #channelislands #freeentry #guernseywithkids See less",
