    {
      "text": "New to the Commercial Market | 45, Longstore, St Peter Port\nAn excellent opportunity to acquire a mixed use property comprising two commercial units and three residential flats, all of which are ideally located within easy reach of the amenities of Admiral Park and St Peter Port.\nThe building is fully let, with all units currently tenanted, providing an immediate income - please contact the sales team for further information.\nhttps://www.cooperbrouard.com/property/81904/ See less",
