    },
    {
      "text": "Come and join the Matalan family!\nIf you want to work for a company that’s passionate about its people, helping you to grow and be the best you can be, then you’ve come to the right place.\nHere at Matalan, we work together, there’s a real sense of belonging and trust, with great teamwork, continuous learning and real career opportunities and rewards.\nAbove all that, we’re a business that’s proud to be a Value Retailer. We provide the best value and the best product in the ways we meet the changing needs of our customers.\nWant a job where you can really make a difference every day and have some fun along the way too? Then come and join us!\n• Senior Sales Assistant – Matalan l Guernsey - Full Time (39hrs)\n• Sales Assistant – Matalan l Guernsey - Full Time (39hrs)\n• Sales Assistant – Matalan l Guernsey - Full Time (32hrs – 4 days p/w)\nGreat rate of pay\n4 weeks holiday increasing with length of service\nUp to 20% off our stores for you and a named friend/family member\nDiscount at local restaurants and island activities\nAttractive contributory pension scheme\nPay-in health care scheme\nLearning and development opportunities\nApply online here: https://sandpiperci.pinpointhq.com/en/matalan See less",
      "date": "",
